{"zh":[{"start":0.01,"end":4.15,"text":"迈克·卡拉汉：我叫迈克·卡拉汉。我是"},{"start":4.17,"end":8.27,"text":"NASA 戈达德太空飞行中心天体生物学分析实验室的"},{"start":8.29,"end":12.38,"text":"研究型物理科学家。我们在陨石里发现了多种核碱基和核碱基"},{"start":12.4,"end":16.46,"text":"类似物。核碱基是什么呢？它是一种小分子，"},{"start":16.48,"end":20.56,"text":"存在于 DNA 和 RNA 中，这些分子对所有生命"},{"start":20.58,"end":24.67,"text":"都必不可少。我们的结果表明这些分子来自地球之外，"},{"start":24.69,"end":28.71,"text":"是陨石上发生的化学反应的产物。"},{"start":28.73,"end":32.76,"text":"我们认为陨石里的这些核碱基来自地外，基于三个"},{"start":32.78,"end":36.8,"text":"理由，第一个是我们在陨石里找到了核碱基类似物。"},{"start":36.82,"end":40.84,"text":"核碱基类似物是一种分子，"},{"start":40.86,"end":44.85,"text":"结构上和生物体里的核碱基相似——"},{"start":44.87,"end":49.0,"text":"但不同之处在于，这些结构在地球上其实很罕见，"},{"start":49.02,"end":53.16,"text":"甚至根本不存在。第二个理由是，"},{"start":53.18,"end":57.27,"text":"除了研究陨石样本，我们也研究地球样本。"},{"start":57.29,"end":61.36,"text":"这些陨石大多是在南极采集的，有一块"},{"start":61.38,"end":65.44,"text":"很有名的叫默奇森，是在澳大利亚采集的。所以我们有"},{"start":65.46,"end":69.53,"text":"澳大利亚默奇森那一带的土壤样本，我们还"},{"start":69.55,"end":73.61,"text":"——我们很幸运，拿到了南极的冰样本，那里"},{"start":73.63,"end":77.67,"text":"采集过其中一些陨石。所以当我们在实验室里"},{"start":77.69,"end":81.71,"text":"检查这些土壤和冰样本时，看不到同样的核碱基分布，"},{"start":81.73,"end":85.74,"text":"至于这些核碱基类似物，在这些地球样本里"},{"start":85.76,"end":89.76,"text":"根本看不到。我们认为陨石里的核碱基来自地外的第三个理由"},{"start":89.78,"end":93.88,"text":"是，我们在实验室里研究氰化氢的反应，"},{"start":93.9,"end":97.99,"text":"当我们从这些氰化氢反应中提取产物时，"},{"start":98.01,"end":102.07,"text":"也得到了核碱基——而且得到的"},{"start":102.09,"end":106.18,"text":"核碱基组合和陨石里的很相似。所以"},{"start":106.2,"end":110.3,"text":"我们看到这一点时非常兴奋，因为我们在想，氰化氢"},{"start":110.32,"end":114.38,"text":"在星际介质里到处都有，很可能"},{"start":114.4,"end":118.44,"text":"在陨石上发生某种化学反应。所以我们看到这一点时，"},{"start":118.46,"end":122.49,"text":"这让我们非常确信，我们看到的东西"},{"start":122.51,"end":126.53,"text":"来自化学反应，而不是某种生物污染"},{"start":126.55,"end":130.55,"text":"进入了陨石。所以这对地球上生命的起源有意义。"},{"start":130.57,"end":134.57,"text":"我们知道陨石里含有氨基酸，它们是蛋白质的组成单元，"},{"start":134.59,"end":138.71,"text":"现在通过我们的研究，我们能证明核碱基"},{"start":138.73,"end":142.84,"text":"——它们是遗传物质的组成单元，比如 DNA 和 RNA——"},{"start":142.86,"end":146.97,"text":"也可能在陨石里找到。所以这些东西合在一起，可能给早期"},{"start":146.99,"end":151.07,"text":"地球播下了这些非常重要的分子，它们可能逐渐组成更大的分子，"},{"start":151.09,"end":155.16,"text":"也就是今天你看到的、对生物必不可少的那些。"}],"de":[],"en":[{"start":0.01,"end":4.15,"text":"Mike Callahan: My name is Mike Callahan. I'm a","words":[["Mike","迈克"],["Callahan:","卡拉汉"],["My","我的"],["name","名字"],["is","是"],["Mike","迈克"],["Callahan.","卡拉汉"],["I'm","我是"],["a","一名"]]},{"start":4.17,"end":8.27,"text":"research physical scientist in the Astrobiology Analytical Laboratory at NASA","words":[["research","研究"],["physical","物理"],["scientist","科学家"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["Astrobiology","天体生物学"],["Analytical","分析"],["Laboratory","实验室"],["at","在"],["NASA","NASA"]]},{"start":8.29,"end":12.38,"text":"Goddard Space Flight Center. We've discovered a variety of nucleobases and nucleobase","words":[["Goddard","戈达德"],["Space","太空"],["Flight","飞行"],["Center.","中心"],["We've","我们已"],["discovered","发现"],["a","一"],["variety","多种"],["of","的"],["nucleobases","核碱基"],["and","和"],["nucleobase","核碱基"]]},{"start":12.4,"end":16.46,"text":"analogs in meteorites. Now what a nucleobase is, is it's a small molecule","words":[["analogs","类似物"],["in","在"],["meteorites.","陨石"],["Now","那"],["what","什么"],["a","一个"],["nucleobase","核碱基"],["is,","是"],["is","是"],["it's","它是"],["a","一种"],["small","小"],["molecule","分子"]]},{"start":16.48,"end":20.56,"text":"that's found in DNA and RNA, and these molecules are essential","words":[["that's","那是"],["found","发现"],["in","在"],["DNA","DNA"],["and","和"],["RNA,","RNA"],["and","而"],["these","这些"],["molecules","分子"],["are","是"],["essential","必不可少"]]},{"start":20.58,"end":24.67,"text":"for all of life. And so our results show that these molecules are extraterrestrial","words":[["for","对"],["all","所有"],["of","的"],["life.","生命"],["And","而"],["so","所以"],["our","我们的"],["results","结果"],["show","显示"],["that","那"],["these","这些"],["molecules","分子"],["are","是"],["extraterrestrial","地外"]]},{"start":24.69,"end":28.71,"text":"in origin, and they're products of a chemical reaction occuring on the meteorite.","words":[["in","在"],["origin,","来源"],["and","和"],["they're","它们是"],["products","产物"],["of","的"],["a","一个"],["chemical","化学"],["reaction","反应"],["occuring","发生"],["on","在"],["the","这"],["meteorite.","陨石"]]},{"start":28.73,"end":32.76,"text":"We believe that these nucleobases in meteorites are extraterrestrial based on three","words":[["We","我们"],["believe","认为"],["that","那"],["these","这些"],["nucleobases","核碱基"],["in","在"],["meteorites","陨石"],["are","是"],["extraterrestrial","地外"],["based","基于"],["on","于"],["three","三个"]]},{"start":32.78,"end":36.8,"text":"reasons, and the first is that we find nucleobase analogs in","words":[["reasons,","理由"],["and","和"],["the","这"],["first","第一"],["is","是"],["that","那"],["we","我们"],["find","找到"],["nucleobase","核碱基"],["analogs","类似物"],["in","在"]]},{"start":36.82,"end":40.84,"text":"meteorites. What a nucleobase analog is, is that, it is a molecule","words":[["meteorites.","陨石"],["What","什么"],["a","一个"],["nucleobase","核碱基"],["analog","类似物"],["is,","是"],["is","是"],["that,","那"],["it","它"],["is","是"],["a","一个"],["molecule","分子"]]},{"start":40.86,"end":44.85,"text":"that is structurally similar to the nucleobases you find in biology--","words":[["that","那"],["is","是"],["structurally","结构上"],["similar","相似"],["to","于"],["the","这"],["nucleobases","核碱基"],["you","你"],["find","找到"],["in","在"],["biology--","生物学—"]]},{"start":44.87,"end":49.0,"text":"but it's different in that these structures are actually either rare","words":[["but","但"],["it's","它是"],["different","不同"],["in","在"],["that","那"],["these","这些"],["structures","结构"],["are","是"],["actually","其实"],["either","要么"],["rare","罕见"]]},{"start":49.02,"end":53.16,"text":"or even absent on Earth. The second reason is that","words":[["or","或"],["even","甚至"],["absent","不存在"],["on","在"],["Earth.","地球"],["The","这"],["second","第二"],["reason","理由"],["is","是"],["that","那"]]},{"start":53.18,"end":57.27,"text":"in addition to looking at meteorite samples, we also study terrestrial samples.","words":[["in","在"],["addition","除了"],["to","于"],["looking","查看"],["at",""],["meteorite","陨石"],["samples,","样本"],["we","我们"],["also","也"],["study","研究"],["terrestrial","地球"],["samples.","样本"]]},{"start":57.29,"end":61.36,"text":"These meteorites are collected mostly in Antarctica, and one","words":[["These","这些"],["meteorites","陨石"],["are","是"],["collected","采集"],["mostly","大多"],["in","在"],["Antarctica,","南极"],["and","和"],["one","一块"]]},{"start":61.38,"end":65.44,"text":"that's very famous called Murchison was collected in Australia. So, we have","words":[["that's","那是"],["very","很"],["famous","有名"],["called","叫"],["Murchison","默奇森"],["was","曾"],["collected","采集"],["in","在"],["Australia.","澳大利亚"],["So,","所以"],["we","我们"],["have","有"]]},{"start":65.46,"end":69.53,"text":"soil samples from that Murchison area in Australia, and we've also","words":[["soil","土壤"],["samples","样本"],["from","来自"],["that","那"],["Murchison","默奇森"],["area","地区"],["in","在"],["Australia,","澳大利亚"],["and","和"],["we've","我们已"],["also","也"]]},{"start":69.55,"end":73.61,"text":"had--we were lucky enough to get an ice sample from Antarctica, where","words":[["had--we","有—我们"],["were","是"],["lucky","幸运"],["enough","足够"],["to","去"],["get","得到"],["an","一份"],["ice","冰"],["sample","样本"],["from","来自"],["Antarctica,","南极"],["where","那里"]]},{"start":73.63,"end":77.67,"text":"some of these meteorites were collected. And so when we look at these soil and ice samples in","words":[["some","一些"],["of","的"],["these","这些"],["meteorites","陨石"],["were","曾"],["collected.","采集"],["And","所以"],["so",""],["when","当"],["we","我们"],["look","看"],["at","在"],["these","这些"],["soil","土壤"],["and","和"],["ice","冰"],["samples","样本"],["in","在"]]},{"start":77.69,"end":81.71,"text":"the laboratory, we don't see the same distribution of nucleobases,","words":[["the","这"],["laboratory,","实验室"],["we","我们"],["don't","不"],["see","看到"],["the","这"],["same","同样"],["distribution","分布"],["of","的"],["nucleobases,","核碱基"]]},{"start":81.73,"end":85.74,"text":"and with these nucleobase analogs, we don't see them at all in these","words":[["and","和"],["with","至于"],["these","这些"],["nucleobase","核碱基"],["analogs,","类似物"],["we","我们"],["don't","不"],["see","看到"],["them","它们"],["at","在"],["all","全部"],["in","在"],["these","这些"]]},{"start":85.76,"end":89.76,"text":"terrestrial samples. The third reason why we think these nucleobases are extraterrestrial in","words":[["terrestrial","地球"],["samples.","样本"],["The","这"],["third","第三"],["reason","理由"],["why","为什么"],["we","我们"],["think","认为"],["these","这些"],["nucleobases","核碱基"],["are","是"],["extraterrestrial","地外"],["in","在"]]},{"start":89.78,"end":93.88,"text":"meteorites is that in the laboratory, we study reactions of hydrogen cyanide,","words":[["meteorites","陨石"],["is","是"],["that","那"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["laboratory,","实验室"],["we","我们"],["study","研究"],["reactions","反应"],["of","的"],["hydrogen","氢"],["cyanide,","氰化物"]]},{"start":93.9,"end":97.99,"text":"and when we extract these products from these hydrogen cyanide","words":[["and","而"],["when","当"],["we","我们"],["extract","提取"],["these","这些"],["products","产物"],["from","从"],["these","这些"],["hydrogen","氢"],["cyanide","氰化物"]]},{"start":98.01,"end":102.07,"text":"reactions, we also get nucleobases--and we actually get a similar","words":[["reactions,","反应"],["we","我们"],["also","也"],["get","得到"],["nucleobases--and","核碱基—而"],["we","我们"],["actually","其实"],["get","得到"],["a","一个"],["similar","相似的"]]},{"start":102.09,"end":106.18,"text":"suite of nucleobases to what's found in the meteorite. And so","words":[["suite","组"],["of","的"],["nucleobases","核碱基"],["to","于"],["what's","什么是"],["found","发现"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["meteorite.","陨石"],["And","所以"],["so",""]]},{"start":106.2,"end":110.3,"text":"when we saw that, we were really excited, because we were thinking, well, hydrogen cyanide","words":[["when","当"],["we","我们"],["saw","看到"],["that,","那"],["we","我们"],["were","曾"],["really","真的"],["excited,","兴奋"],["because","因为"],["we","我们"],["were","曾"],["thinking,","在想"],["well,","嗯"],["hydrogen","氢"],["cyanide","氰化物"]]},{"start":110.32,"end":114.38,"text":"is dispersed everywhere in the interstellar medium, and it's likely","words":[["is","是"],["dispersed","散布"],["everywhere","到处"],["in","在"],["the","这"],["interstellar","星际"],["medium,","介质"],["and","而"],["it's","它是"],["likely","可能"]]},{"start":114.4,"end":118.44,"text":"to have some sort of chemical reaction on the meteorite. And so, when we saw that,","words":[["to","去"],["have","有"],["some","某种"],["sort","种"],["of","的"],["chemical","化学"],["reaction","反应"],["on","在"],["the","这"],["meteorite.","陨石"],["And","所以"],["so,",""],["when","当"],["we","我们"],["saw","看到"],["that,","那"]]},{"start":118.46,"end":122.49,"text":"that really convinced us a lot that we're seeing something from","words":[["that","那"],["really","真的"],["convinced","说服"],["us","我们"],["a","一"],["lot","很多"],["that","那"],["we're","我们是"],["seeing","看到"],["something","某物"],["from","来自"]]},{"start":122.51,"end":126.53,"text":"a chemical reaction rather than some sort of biological contamination coming","words":[["a","一个"],["chemical","化学"],["reaction","反应"],["rather","而"],["than","不是"],["some","某种"],["sort","种"],["of","的"],["biological","生物"],["contamination","污染"],["coming","进入"]]},{"start":126.55,"end":130.55,"text":"into the meteorite. So, this has implications for the origin of life on Earth.","words":[["into","进"],["the","这"],["meteorite.","陨石"],["So,","所以"],["this","这"],["has","有"],["implications","意义"],["for","对"],["the","这"],["origin","起源"],["of","的"],["life","生命"],["on","在"],["Earth.","地球"]]},{"start":130.57,"end":134.57,"text":"We know that meteorites contain animo acids, which are the building blocks of your proteins,","words":[["We","我们"],["know","知道"],["that","那"],["meteorites","陨石"],["contain","含有"],["animo","氨基"],["acids,","酸"],["which","它们"],["are","是"],["the","这"],["building","组成"],["blocks","单元"],["of","的"],["your","你的"],["proteins,","蛋白质"]]},{"start":134.59,"end":138.71,"text":"and now from our research, we can show that nucleobases","words":[["and","而"],["now","现在"],["from","从"],["our","我们的"],["research,","研究"],["we","我们"],["can","能"],["show","证明"],["that","那"],["nucleobases","核碱基"]]},{"start":138.73,"end":142.84,"text":"--which are the building blocks of your genetic material, like DNA and RNA--","words":[["--which","—它们"],["are","是"],["the","这"],["building","组成"],["blocks","单元"],["of","的"],["your","你的"],["genetic","遗传"],["material,","物质"],["like","像"],["DNA","DNA"],["and","和"],["RNA--","RNA—"]]},{"start":142.86,"end":146.97,"text":"could be found in meteorites. And so these things together could have seeded an early","words":[["could","能"],["be","被"],["found","发现"],["in","在"],["meteorites.","陨石"],["And","所以"],["so",""],["these","这些"],["things","东西"],["together","一起"],["could","可能"],["have","有"],["seeded","播种"],["an","一个"],["early","早期"]]},{"start":146.99,"end":151.07,"text":"Earth with these really important molecules that could have built up to the larger molecules","words":[["Earth","地球"],["with","以"],["these","这些"],["really","真的"],["important","重要的"],["molecules","分子"],["that","那"],["could","可能"],["have","有"],["built","构建"],["up","起"],["to","到"],["the","这"],["larger","更大的"],["molecules","分子"]]},{"start":151.09,"end":155.16,"text":"you see today that are essential for biology.","words":[["you","你"],["see","看到"],["today","今天"],["that","那"],["are","是"],["essential","必不可少"],["for","对"],["biology.","生物学"]]}]}